        "raw": "<p>So we went to see Justice League last week, and something in the opening scene caught my attention.</p><p>It starts with a bunch of kids asking Superman some questions for a video blog. One of them asks if he&#39;s ever fought a hippo. Another says that&#39;s a dumb question and the first kid protests &quot;It&#39;s the most dangerous animal!&quot;</p><p>I know, the movie was in production well before the Nemesis podcast went live, but I just think it&#39;s funny that apparently the DCEU writers and Christopher and Adam ended up on the same page there.</p>",
