        "created_at": "2017-12-01T20:37:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would Love if it was a reference. Of course they also have a semi-MiB reference in there. When the first MiB movie came up 2 of the \"Aliens\" on the big monitor in the background were Prince &amp; David Bowie, and the headline of a newspaper in the opening sequence pulled the MiB line about Elvis \"Did they just go home?\"</p>",
